{"id":"n64485-1-8","stage":4,"title":"감탄사 · 叹词","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64485-1-8-1","ko":"영화의 마지막 장면이 정말 멋있었지?","zh":"电影的最后一个场景真的太棒了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영화의","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화의","audio":"/audio/fac7459b98f5f545f7bb.mp3"}},{"text":"마지막","meaning":"最后，最终，末了","explanation":"마지막：最后，最终，末了","readings":[{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28843","senseId":"1","lemma":"마지막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}},{"text":"장면이","meaning":"场面","explanation":"장면：场面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장면","audio":"/audio/5727c93714b0d8b05307.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24815","senseId":"2","lemma":"장면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장면이","audio":"/audio/74ae9ab24569d6b2aef7.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"멋있었지?","meaning":"帅气，优秀","explanation":"멋있다：帅气，优秀；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋있었지","audio":"/audio/dcf8e681da0832ba1891.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"8da62ef6312ba9ce","term":"마지막","zh":"最后，最终，末了","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3","entryId":"28843","definition":"在时间上或次序上的末尾。","pronunciation":["마지막"]},{"id":"5727c93714b0d8b0","term":"장면","zh":"场面","audio":"/audio/5727c93714b0d8b05307.mp3","entryId":"24815","definition":"电影或戏剧的瞬间、情景。","pronunciation":["장면"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"79ca95990baff4c4","term":"멋있다","zh":"帅气，优秀","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3","entryId":"15989","definition":"很好或很出众。","pronunciation":["머딛따","머싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2aaa281e1cbc352fcecd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64485-1-8-2","ko":"응, 나도 모르게 감탄사가 터지더라.","zh":"嗯，我不知不觉就发出赞叹声了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"모르게","meaning":"不知不觉","explanation":"모르다：不知不觉；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"8","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르게","audio":"/audio/24b23d321148f26a5eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"감탄사가","meaning":"叹词","explanation":"감탄사：叹词；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감탄사","audio":"/audio/c4151e7c88ccc9a4eba1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64485","senseId":"1","lemma":"감탄사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceRe